@startuml seq_s1_revoke
title Sequence — Instant session revocation by token version

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam actorBorderColor #808080
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam participantBorderColor #808080
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam databaseBorderColor #808080
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #808080
skinparam sequenceReferenceBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #808080
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam TitleFontSize 13
skinparam TitleFontColor #333333
autonumber

actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "Target user" as U
participant "Angular SPA" as SPA
participant "JwtAuthenticationFilter" as JWT
participant "UserService" as US
participant "TokenVersionCache\n(Caffeine)" as C
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Admin -> US : deactivate the account
US -> DB : tokenVersion + 1
DB --> US : ok
US -> C : evict(userId)

== the user still holds a valid, unexpired token ==

U -> SPA : open a business screen
SPA -> JWT : GET /api/projects\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
JWT -> JWT : signature and expiry: valid
JWT -> C : version(userId)
C -> DB : read tokenVersion (cache miss)
DB --> C : version = n + 1
C --> JWT : n + 1
JWT -> JWT : token carries n, stored is n + 1
JWT --> SPA : 401 Unauthorized
SPA --> U : signed out

note over JWT, C
  No blacklist to keep: a counter comparison
  revokes every token issued before the change.
end note

@enduml
